ity, Planning and Development;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"66 FR 66262 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 2(c)","sha256":"e1d51afb093fa701e8e644b23620ba1358584b3c0e742361ab6dae279e44df3b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-21/pdf/01-31668.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13243#sec2(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d) Assistant Secretary of Housing and Urban Development in charge\nof Public and Indian Housing;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"66 FR 66262 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 2(d)","sha256":"e1d51afb093fa701e8e644b23620ba1358584b3c0e742361ab6dae279e44df3b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-21/pdf/01-31668.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13243#sec2(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(e) Assistant Secretary of Housing and Urban Development in charge of\nPolicy Development and Research;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"66 FR 66262 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 2(e)","sha256":"e1d51afb093fa701e8e644b23620ba1358584b3c0e742361ab6dae279e44df3b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-21/pdf/01-31668.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13243#sec2(e)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(f) Assistant Secretary of Housing and Urban Development in charge of\nFair Housing and Equal Opportunity;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"66 FR 66262 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 2(f)","sha256":"e1d51afb093fa701e8e644b23620ba1358584b3c0e742361ab6dae279e44df3b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-21/pdf/01-31668.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13243#sec2(f)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(g) Assistant Secretary of Housing and Urban Development in charge of\nCongressional and Intergovernmental Relations;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"66 FR 66262 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 2(g)","sha256":"e